<title>SINGAPORE: Straits Trading gets site for S$308 mln.</title>
<headline>Straits Trading gets site for S$308 mln.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Urban Redevelopment Authority said on Wednesday it has awarded a site in Singapore's downtown area to highest bidder Merevale Pte Ltd for Singapore $308 million.</p>
<p>Merevale is a unit of Straits Trading Company Ltd.</p>
<p>The 13,981.7 sq metre site, called China Square Parcel F, can be used for commercial and/or residential development.</p>
<p>- Singapore Newsroom 65-8703080</p>
</text>
